<title>FINLAND: CHIPS TO RECEIVE FIM 25 MLN FOR PLASTO.</title>
<headline>CHIPS TO RECEIVE FIM 25 MLN FOR PLASTO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish potato chips maker Ab Chips Oy Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday it would receive 25 million markka in cash for the earlier announced sale of its toy unit Ab Plasto Oy Ltd to Sweden's Brio .</p>
<p>&quot;The transfer will take place on January 2, 1997,&quot; Chips added.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
